usage: prog [-h] [--mode {debug,release}] [--jobs jobs] src [src ...]

Do things with prog.

positional arguments:
  src  sources

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --mode {debug,release}  build mode
  --jobs jobs  jobs (default: 4)

See prog --help.
---
usage: git [-h] [--retries retries] [--verbose] CMD ...

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  -v, --verbose  loud

network:
  connection options
  --retries retries  retry count

commands:
  pick one
  cmd  {build,test,b}
